&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for our mission to make high-quality language learning accessible to everyone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile apps and subscription services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience successfully scaling international brands in Turkey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in a 3rd language&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
